<BaseLayout
  title="KVEraser: Learning to Erase Context from the KV Cache | Catpuccino.ai"
  description="KVEraser learns to steer KV cache states for efficient post-hoc context erasing—replacing only erased-span KVs while reusing the suffix, achieving near-perfect quality with only 24% latency growth vs 17.6× for full recomputation."
  crumb="KVEraser"
>

