  <h1>KVEraser: Erasing Context from the KV Cache Without Recomputation</h1>
  <p class="lead">When a stale retrieval, wrong tool result, or harmful injection is buried in a prefilled context, the only exact fix—rerunning prefill over the entire suffix—costs as much as re-processing a whole document. KVEraser learns to replace just the erased span's KV states with lightweight steering vectors, keeping suffix KVs unchanged, and achieves near-perfect quality with only 24% latency growth where full recomputation balloons 17.6×.</p>
